---
tags: [lamb, rice]
cuisine: Burmese
---

Chop and blend @onion{2} in a #food processor{}.

Pour @sunflower oil{}

Pour onions into #pressure cooker{} (low heat to prevent splashing)

Put in @garlic paste{2%tsp} and @ginger paste{2%tsp} and mix

Boil @water{3/4%jug}

Add @tumeric{1%tsp}, @jeeru{1%tsp}, @chilli powder{3/4%tsp}, @daara{1%tsp}, @salt{1%tsp}, @black pepper{1/4%tsp} and mix

Put @lamb{350%g} in. Wait until it's 'sealed'

Put half jug water in, check it's boiled before closing pressure cooker lid. Wait ~{30%minutes}.

> If the meat can be broken, it's finished

Serve with @./Boiled Rice{recipe}